FAILURE MODES
--------------
1. SYSTEM PROMPT EVICTION
   After many tool calls, trimming drops the system prompt (oldest message).
   Agent loses all instructions. Starts hallucinating its own rules.
   Fix: always protect messages[0] from trimming.

2. CONTEXT POISONING (SECURITY)
   Attacker sends a 50,000-token document through a tool call.
   Pushes security constraints and user permissions out of the window.
   Agent operates without those constraints.
   Relevant to your garak contributions.

3. LOST IN THE MIDDLE IN RAG
   10 retrieved chunks injected into context.
   Answer is in chunk 5 (the middle). Model ignores it.
   Fix: rerank so most relevant chunk is always first or last.

